; Exceptions (--mode=objfpc): errors in raise and try statements.
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/exceptions/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; A bare raise needs an enclosing handler of the same routine.
; CHECK: errors.pas:10:3: error: 'raise' without an object (a re-raise) is only allowed in an exception handler
; CHECK: errors.pas:14:9: error: 'raise' needs an object of a class type, not 'integer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:15:9: error: 'raise' needs an object of a class type, not 'TRec'
; CHECK: errors.pas:16:9: error: 'raise' needs an object of a class type, not 'nil'
; CHECK: errors.pas:17:3: error: 'raise' without an object (a re-raise) is only allowed in an exception handler
; CHECK: errors.pas:21:11: error: 'TRec' is not a class type
; CHECK-NEXT: E: TRec
; CHECK: errors.pas:3:3: note: 'TRec' declared here
; CHECK: errors.pas:22:11: error: unknown class name 'Missing'
; Free Pascal: "Control flow statements are not allowed in a finally block".
; CHECK: errors.pas:27:5: error: 'exit' is not allowed in a 'finally' part
; CHECK: errors.pas:32:7: error: 'break' cannot leave a 'finally' part
; CHECK: errors.pas:33:7: error: 'continue' cannot leave a 'finally' part
; EDivByZero is predeclared (line 38); the handler's variable is visible in
; the handler only.
; CHECK: errors.pas:40:11: error: use of undeclared identifier 'E'
; CHECK-NOT: error

; Exception's field is private; its constructor takes the message.
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -c %S/Inputs/exceptions/members.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=MEMBERS %s
; MEMBERS: members.pas:7:13: error: 'FMessage' is a private member of 'Exception'
; MEMBERS: members.pas:8:18: error: missing arguments in call to 'Create'
; MEMBERS-NOT: error

; As in Free Pascal (without -Sg), objfpc has no labels and gotos: an error
; at each label section and goto, nothing else.
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/exceptions/goto.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=GOTO %s
; GOTO: goto.pas:2:1: error: labels and 'goto' are not supported with --mode=objfpc
; GOTO: goto.pas:4:3: error: labels and 'goto' are not supported with --mode=objfpc
; GOTO: goto.pas:7:3: error: labels and 'goto' are not supported with --mode=objfpc
; GOTO-NOT: error
; RUN: %p3 --mode=tp -c %S/Inputs/exceptions/goto.pas -o %t.o

; Without --mode=objfpc there are no exceptions: try and raise are
; identifiers, Exception is not declared and sysutils is an ordinary unit.
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=tp -c %S/Inputs/exceptions/tp.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=TP %s
; TP: tp.pas:4:6: error: unknown type name 'Exception'
; TP: tp.pas:5:6: error: unknown type name 'EDivByZero'
; TP-NOT: error
